This just blocks my view, there's no need for a wall.

112
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:26,460
He's doing the same thing he did to us.

113
00:07:26,460 --> 00:07:32,970
Müller waves the wall aside, just like he did in the Uruguay match.

114
00:07:32,970 --> 00:07:36,970
This goalkeeper's confidence is very high.

115
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:39,480
