- Damn.
- He's mocking us.

117
00:07:49,620 --> 00:07:52,210
Even from this distance, he has no blind spot.

118
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,490
What should I do?

119
00:07:54,790 --> 00:07:59,050
Take aim, Tsubasa. Now that we're free of the wall...

120
00:07:59,550 --> 00:08:02,930
...target the goalkeeper and shoot with all your might.

121
00:08:03,090 --> 00:08:04,500
Hyuga.

122
00:08:05,090 --> 00:08:06,970
Yes, you're right.

123
00:08:08,250 --> 00:08:09,970
Right, Hyuga!

124
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:15,010
Oh, it seems like Tsubasa and Hyuga are whispering a plan.

125
00:08:15,940 --> 00:08:18,270
Alright, I understand, Tsubasa.

126
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,190
Yes.

127
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:21,020
Useless.

128
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:25,490
And now, will it be Tsubasa or Hyuga to take the free kick?

129
00:08:25,570 --> 00:08:29,530
Or will they pretend to shoot and pass instead?

130
00:08:29,740 --> 00:08:30,660
Come on!

131
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:33,570
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

132
00:08:34,170 --> 00:08:37,280
Both are running.

133
00:08:37,790 --> 00:08:38,580
What!?

134
00:08:39,460 --> 00:08:41,630
Is this a Drive Shot or a Tiger Shot?

135
00:08:41,710 --> 00:08:43,790
No one can guess.

136
00:08:44,130 --> 00:08:46,420
We trust you, Tsubasa, Hyuga.

137
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:47,460
Müller!

138
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:50,850
This trick doesn't work on me.

139
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:53,470
Whatever shot comes, I'll catch it.

140
00:08:53,730 --> 00:08:55,470
They are rivals in Japan.

141
00:08:55,940 --> 00:08:58,270
But now, Tsubasa and Hyuga are working together.

142
00:08:58,690 --> 00:09:00,720
Tsubasa is more in front.

143
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:03,730
But still no one can guess who will shoot!

144
00:09:03,730 --> 00:09:05,990
Tsubasa or Hyuga?

145
00:09:06,070 --> 00:09:06,980
Alright.

146
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:07,910
What?

147
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:13,620
Tsubasa touches the ball while running.

148
00:09:13,710 --> 00:09:15,990
He flicks it in front of him!

149
00:09:15,990 --> 00:09:17,740
Your turn, Hyuga.

150
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:23,170
The Japan team plans to get as close as possible and then shoot.

151
00:09:23,260 --> 00:09:25,170
- Damn.
- So that's how you'll play.

152
00:09:25,550 --> 00:09:30,250
And here is Japan's best forward and shooter, Kojiro Hyuga.

153
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:33,560
Tsubasa flicked it in front of me but it's still far.

154
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:37,510
What should I aim at to score against this goalkeeper?

155
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:39,510
Damn. They're getting closer.

156
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:42,900
I'll trust my instincts.

157
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:45,020
My instincts as a forward.

158
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,020
Catch!

159
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:49,480
