160
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:54,280
New Tiger Shot!

161
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:03,790
Oh, this is directly at the goalkeeper.

162
00:10:08,380 --> 00:10:09,290
Müller!

163
00:10:12,850 --> 00:10:14,340
He stopped it!

164
00:10:15,140 --> 00:10:20,400
The unexpected straight ball surprised Müller for a moment.

165
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:23,980
But still, he was able to drop to his knees and catch the ball tightly.

166
00:10:24,570 --> 00:10:30,030
Hyuga's New Tiger Shot is equivalent to Schneider's Fire Shot.

167
00:10:30,110 --> 00:10:32,480
But unfortunately, it wasn't a goal.

168
00:10:32,700 --> 00:10:37,410
Still, it was powerful enough to push Müller back.

169
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:42,540
His shot is certainly faster than when we played in Hamburg.

170
00:10:43,210 --> 00:10:48,000
The Japan team is completely different from how they played back then.

171
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:50,890
So maybe...?

172
00:10:51,430 --> 00:10:52,510
Tsubasa.

173
00:10:53,180 --> 00:10:55,560
We might score between his legs.

174
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,640
What?

175
00:10:56,140 --> 00:10:58,890
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

