226
00:14:22,570 --> 00:14:25,340
A long-distance shot from Tsubasa!

227
00:14:25,620 --> 00:14:27,790
This is not his special Drive Shot!

228
00:14:27,870 --> 00:14:29,830
This is a ground shot!

229
00:14:29,910 --> 00:14:30,840
This is my shot!

230
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:33,350
But this is also directly at the goalkeeper.

231
00:14:35,630 --> 00:14:38,100
