247
00:15:22,310 --> 00:15:25,300
An unexpected collision!

248
00:15:26,260 --> 00:15:27,610
Tsubasa!

249
00:15:27,610 --> 00:15:28,610
Tsubasa!

250
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:30,310
Tsubasa!

251
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:32,060
Tsubasa collapses to the ground.

252
00:15:32,140 --> 00:15:33,190
Guys, forward.

253
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:34,100
Okay.

254
00:15:34,190 --> 00:15:38,570
Germany uses Japan's shock for an attack.

255
00:15:39,110 --> 00:15:41,370
Tsubasa can't stand up.

256
00:15:41,690 --> 00:15:45,740
Müller's strike came to his face from close range.

257
00:15:45,820 --> 00:15:48,080
He must be seriously injured.

258
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,630
Tsubasa.

259
00:15:49,830 --> 00:15:53,140
Stop it, referee! You must stop the game!

260
00:15:53,670 --> 00:15:54,960
Now there's a chance to score.

261
00:15:55,210 --> 00:15:59,090
Before the tournament, everyone thought Japan was weak.

262
00:15:59,390 --> 00:16:03,010
