263
00:16:03,090 --> 00:16:06,520
They came here because they have Tsubasa and strong teamwork.

264
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:10,180
They call it football with all their might, or the football of Japan's children.

265
00:16:10,430 --> 00:16:15,230
With Tsubasa's injury...

266
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:19,200
...the integrity of the team is at risk.

267
00:16:19,820 --> 00:16:22,410
Now a great opportunity for Germany.

268
00:16:22,410 --> 00:16:24,120
Pull yourselves together, guys.

269
