271
00:16:32,620 --> 00:16:36,890
We must take a lesson from Tsubasa's courage and all defend together.

272
00:16:37,170 --> 00:16:38,170
Wakabayashi!

273
00:16:38,250 --> 00:16:40,640
- We will defend until the end.
- Yes.

274
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:42,560
Well done, Wakabayashi.

275
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:44,810
But I will still score.

276
00:16:45,430 --> 00:16:46,430
Kaltz!

277
00:16:46,970 --> 00:16:51,220
Germany's golden duo, Schester and Kaltz, in midfield.

278
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:55,030
The Japan team is recovering thanks to Wakabayashi.

279
00:16:55,230 --> 00:16:56,200
But...

280
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:00,410
Woo-hoo!

281
00:17:00,410 --> 00:17:03,660
The midfield without Tsubasa belongs to Germany!

282
00:17:04,150 --> 00:17:06,170
The ball goes to Schester once again.

283
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:10,920
Star forward Schneider comes in front of Japan's goal.

284
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:12,370
Stop him!

285
00:17:12,450 --> 00:17:13,580
I'll cut him off.

286
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:16,000
Schester.

287
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:18,680
Okay, Schneider.

288
00:17:19,380 --> 00:17:23,430
Schester sends a pass to Schneider in front of the goal.

289
00:17:23,460 --> 00:17:24,440
I won't allow it!

290
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:26,940
But Misaki catches up with a tackle!

291
00:17:28,690 --> 00:17:32,690
Schester gets past him with a leap!

292
00:17:38,230 --> 00:17:39,700
Handsome! Schester!

293
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:43,190
Oh, but this is not a pass to Schneider!

294
00:17:43,270 --> 00:17:45,460
This is a long pass to Margas.

295
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:46,460
Wasn't it supposed to be to Schneider?

296
00:17:47,420 --> 00:17:51,070
Oh, but Schneider turns and runs toward the ball.

297
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,050
What?

298
00:17:52,280 --> 00:17:54,380
Margas goes for a header.

299
00:17:55,910 --> 00:17:58,180
Jito jumps to block him.

300
00:18:01,750 --> 00:18:04,000
Both are evenly matched!

301
00:18:06,010 --> 00:18:07,100
Schneider is catching up!

302
00:18:07,300 --> 00:18:11,970
As if he knew their duel would end in a draw.

303
00:18:12,050 --> 00:18:12,940
Good.

304
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,440
And he leaps into the air.

305
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:19,450
Schneider goes to make an overhead kick from a free position!

306
00:18:19,450 --> 00:18:23,440
Father, mother, Marie, I hope you're watching.

307
00:18:23,650 --> 00:18:25,570
Germany wins.

308
00:18:25,650 --> 00:18:29,750
And I become the best player in the world.

309
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:31,450
Big brother!

310
00:18:31,910 --> 00:18:33,030
Karl!

311
00:18:33,910 --> 00:18:36,740
He's scoring. Schneider is definitely scoring.

312
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:39,760
Germany's new emperor, Schneider.

313
00:18:39,760 --> 00:18:44,850
Schneider will build the golden age of German football.

314
00:18:44,850 --> 00:18:47,260
Schneider scores.

315
00:18:47,340 --> 00:18:50,100
He said he would score this time.

316
00:18:50,510 --> 00:18:54,510
I'll cut him off! The overhead kick is Tsubasa's specialty.

317
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:57,570
It's impossible for him to score with Tsubasa's specialty.

318
00:18:57,930 --> 00:19:04,230
Tsubasa and I came to Germany to make Japan number one in the world.

319
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:06,110
I'll catch it, Schneider!

320
00:19:07,110 --> 00:19:10,080
Oh, Schneider didn't shoot!

321
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:11,080
What!?

322
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:13,590
Schneider lands.

323
00:19:13,780 --> 00:19:15,090
What is he up to?

324
00:19:17,660 --> 00:19:19,340
This was his intention.

325
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:26,350
Damn. I can't see.

326
00:19:26,350 --> 00:19:28,600
This goal, Wakabayashi.

327
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:31,920
Schneider lands and turns.

328
00:19:32,010 --> 00:19:33,720
And shoots!

329
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:36,100
Fire!

330
00:19:39,110 --> 00:19:40,110
Wakabayashi!

331
00:19:41,860 --> 00:19:42,870
Damn.

332
00:19:42,870 --> 00:19:45,620
Wakabayashi reacts 1 second too late.

333
00:19:52,820 --> 00:19:54,130
Goal!

334
00:19:54,450 --> 00:19:56,120
In the net!

335
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:59,630
In the final match of the first National Youth Tournament in France...

336
00:19:59,990 --> 00:20:02,830
In the 22nd minute of the first half...

337
00:20:02,910 --> 00:20:04,830
The German youth score the first goal.

338
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:08,210
We did it! Goal! Schneider scored!

339
00:20:08,380 --> 00:20:10,550
Germany scored the first goal!

340
00:20:14,180 --> 00:20:17,140
It was a blazing fire shot!

341
00:20:17,220 --> 00:20:22,810
Schneider scored in every match of this tournament and took his place in the top scorer chart.

342
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,310
Your shot was great!

343
00:20:24,390 --> 00:20:26,870
He did it, Schneider.

344
00:20:27,150 --> 00:20:34,070
Super goalkeeper Wakabayashi couldn't stop it this time.

345
00:20:34,150 --> 00:20:35,130
Damn.

346
00:20:35,360 --> 00:20:38,660
They finally scored the first goal.

347
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:40,990
We had fought so well...

348
00:20:41,080 --> 00:20:45,790
Jito and Margas blocked his view and caused him to be 1 second late.

349
00:20:46,580 --> 00:20:49,460
I can't believe he calculated all of this.

350
00:20:50,380 --> 00:20:53,590
We won. This 1 goal is enough.

351
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:56,300
We won!

352
00:20:56,900 --> 00:21:00,050
Schneider! Schneider!

353
00:21:00,140 --> 00:21:02,970
Schneider! Schneider!

354
00:21:03,060 --> 00:21:07,850
Schneider raises his right hand to the sky and makes a fist!

355
00:21:07,940 --> 00:21:11,410
As if he declared victory with this goal!

356
00:21:12,030 --> 00:21:15,420
The world youth champion...

357
00:21:15,610 --> 00:21:19,420
will be Karl Heinz Schneider.

358
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:23,870
Did you see, father, mother, Marie?

359
00:21:24,330 --> 00:21:30,430
Germany and I have seized victory and placed ourselves at the top of the world.

360
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,300
Big brother.

361
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:33,960
Karl.

362
00:21:35,170 --> 00:21:38,010
The game has only just begun!

363
00:21:40,190 --> 00:21:41,010
- What?
- Tsubasa!

364
00:21:41,100 --> 00:21:42,690
Are you okay, Tsubasa?

365
00:21:44,390 --> 00:21:48,310
I'm fine. I'm fine. The ball is always my friend.

366
00:21:48,520 --> 00:21:51,060
We're only one goal behind!

367
00:21:51,150 --> 00:21:56,210
First we'll equalize, then we'll take the lead, guys!

368
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,450
Tsubasa.

369
00:21:57,530 --> 00:21:59,200
Yes, Tsubasa!

370
00:22:03,870 --> 00:22:04,990
Tsubasa.

371
00:23:46,710 --> 00:24:49,950
Next Episode: The Strongest Shot in History